いや、みんなだけあって、ニコたちないの？
Wait, is it only Niko? Do Niko and the others not cry?

289
00:31:34,972 --> 00:31:36,632
私も最初さ、
I was at first...

290
00:31:36,632 --> 00:31:38,312
どうしよう、どうしよう！
What should I do, what should I do!

291
00:31:38,312 --> 00:31:39,612
ないよ、ない！
No way, I didn't!

292
00:31:39,612 --> 00:31:42,572
ない、ない！リオナはどうだった？ねえ？
No, no! How about Riona? Right?

293
00:31:42,572 --> 00:31:47,452
みんな出してくれてありがとう！これだけでもね、やんわりとしておきまして...
Thank you everyone for letting us put it out! Let's keep it under wraps for now...

294
00:33:31,612 --> 00:33:41,352
まるでこの世界で二人だけみたいだね
It's as if we're the only two people in this world.

295
00:33:41,812 --> 00:33:51,692
なんて少しだけ夢を見てしまっただけ
I just dreamed a little dream like that for a moment.

296
00:33:51,992 --> 00:34:02,652
つま先に突き刺かりあなたの香りに指に触れる指
Sinking into my toes, your scent, fingers touching fingers.

297
00:34:03,292 --> 00:34:13,292
さよなら もういかなきゃ 何もかも忘れて
Goodbye, I have to go now, forgetting everything.

298
00:34:15,192 --> 00:34:22,972
ガラスの上を裸のまま歩むごとに血が流れて落ちていく
Walking barefoot over glass, blood flowing and falling with every step.

299
00:34:27,672 --> 00:34:37,068
骨が痛い その赤い足跡を辿って逢いに来て
My bones ache, follow those red footprints and come meet me.

300
00:37:40,091 --> 00:37:49,971
罪と罰 朝の山手通り道 煙草の空き箱を捨てる
Crime and punishment... tossing an empty pack of cigarettes on Yamate Street in the morning...

301
00:37:51,391 --> 00:37:57,591
今日もまた足の踏み場もない部屋が孤独を甘やかかす
Today too, my room with no place to step pampers my solitude...

302
00:37:58,391 --> 00:38:05,711
女んなお姫を愛さないで 未来など見ないで隠し続けて
Don't love a woman like a princess... don't look toward the future, keep hiding it...

303
00:38:16,191 --> 00:38:27,571
私の名前をちゃんと呼んで 身体を触って 必要なのはこれだけ認めて
Call my name properly, touch my body... acknowledge that this is all I need...

304
00:38:41,471 --> 00:38:46,591
愛している ひとり泣き叫んで
I love you... crying and screaming alone...

305
00:38:46,891 --> 00:38:53,391
夜道をまさぐれども空しい
Fumbling down the night road is all in vain...

306
00:38:53,971 --> 00:39:01,551
逢いさるなよ あなたの影すら落とさない
Don't run away... don't even let your shadow fall...

307
00:39:01,971 --> 00:39:13,371
浮かんだ無上の時も セブンスターの香りに味わうごとき季節を呼び起こす
Even the floating moments of eternity summon a season tasted in the scent of Seven Stars...

308
00:39:14,171 --> 00:39:23,571
私が望んだこと自体 矛盾を裕に越えて一番愛しいあなたの声まで
What I wished for easily surpassed contradiction, reaching all the way to your dearest voice...

309
00:39:27,171 --> 00:39:36,971
かすれさせていたんだ
which I had let grow hoarse.

310
00:39:57,571 --> 00:39:59,092
静寂を
Silence...

311
00:40:00,262 --> 00:40:02,722
ねぇ あなた買ってちょうだい
Hey, buy this for me...

312
00:40:02,902 --> 00:40:05,202
ルイーズ・セドゥ
Louise Ceder...

313
00:40:05,702 --> 00:40:08,662
パトカー
A police car...

314
00:40:09,082 --> 00:40:14,902
ああ サイレンが爆音を上げる現実界
Ah, the reality where sirens wail deafeningly.

315
00:40:15,622 --> 00:40:21,182
歩くウォーカー 浮世離れした
Walking walkers, detached from the floating world,

316
00:40:21,182 --> 00:40:27,842
女王な姫を愛さないで 未来など見ないで
Don't love a queenly princess, don't look toward a future or anything.

317
00:40:27,842 --> 00:40:30,502
確信できる
I can be certain.

318
00:40:30,502 --> 00:40:34,042
今だけ重ねてあたしの名前をちゃんと呼んで
Just for now, overlap us, call my name properly,

319
00:40:34,042 --> 00:40:44,902
身体を触って必要なのはこれだけ認めて
touch my body, acknowledge that this is all I need.

320
00:40:45,482 --> 00:40:57,002
女王な姫を愛さないで 未来など見ないで 確信できる 今だけ重ねてあたしの名前をちゃんと呼んで
Don't love a queenly princess, don't look toward a future or anything, I can be certain. Just for now, overlap us, call my name properly,

321
00:40:57,262 --> 00:41:08,942
身体を触って必要なのはこれだけ認めて
touch my body, acknowledge that this is all I need.

322
00:41:21,182 --> 00:41:32,502
さあさ 朝の山の手通りで タバコの吸い殻を捨てて
Now, come on, on the morning Yamanote Street, throwing away cigarette butts,

323
00:41:33,542 --> 00:41:43,882
今日もまだ 足の踏み場はない 濁った河底を青空が
today still, there's no place to step, the muddy riverbed...

324
00:41:44,342 --> 00:41:53,202
さらさらら
rustling...

325
00:42:19,422 --> 00:42:22,542
ねえ あなた買ってちょうだい
Hey, buy this for me...

326
00:42:40,242 --> 00:42:52,422
誰一人奪うてめえの手のスカイに夢中 悪魔の飼い方分かってる
Everyone is obsessed with the sky of their own stolen hands, knowing how to raise a devil.

327
00:42:52,422 --> 00:43:03,202
選ばれるためなら明日を売る 裏切られた分だけ墓を掘る
Selling tomorrow just to be chosen, digging a grave for every betrayal.

328
00:43:04,202 --> 00:43:19,422
逃げる escape escape 仏のまま 飛べる step step step お前のまま
Running, escape escape, remaining like Buddha, flying, step step step, just like you.

329
00:43:19,422 --> 00:43:29,202
アンダースタンド アンダースタンド この閻魔様さえ食らって語る
Understand, understand, even devouring this Enma-sama and talking.

330
00:43:46,942 --> 00:43:59,302
日々の沁みを木枯に比べてダウンを取り合う
Comparing daily stains to the withered wind and taking down each other.

331
00:43:59,302 --> 00:44:09,202
切り落とした彼の死讐は散々になる 知りもせずに意味を美意識だと崇める
The severed remains of his revenge become scattered, blindly worshipping the meaning as aesthetic sense.

332
00:44:09,202 --> 00:44:24,422
記事へ地道た死に方に本能を散った 奇怪なごたくの吹き飛びに
Scattering instincts in a steadily dead way to articles, blowing away strange excuses.

333
00:44:24,422 --> 00:44:36,202
上っ面の雑司でかわいがって くだらない嘘と踊るくらいなら 悪魔と手を繋ぐわ
Acting cute with superficial words, if I'm going to dance with silly lies, I'll join hands with the devil.

334
00:44:37,422 --> 00:44:50,202
逃げる escape escape 仏のまま 飛べる step step step お前のまま
Running, escape escape, remaining like Buddha, flying, step step step, just like you.

335
00:44:50,202 --> 00:45:04,642
アンダースタンド アンダースタンド この閻魔様さえ食らって語る
Understand, understand, even devouring this Enma-sama and talking.

336
00:45:34,880 --> 00:45:38,580
ありがとうございまーす！みんなありがとー！
Thank you so much! Thank you everyone!

337
00:45:39,080 --> 00:45:46,080
はーい、ちょっと待ってね。お水飲んできてくださいね、すいませんね。
Alright, hold on a second. Go grab some water, sorry about that...

338
00:45:49,280 --> 00:46:00,880
お待たせいたしました！お待たせしちゃいましたね。えっと、先ほどはジャンドゥーと罪と罰と阿修羅ちゃんをお届けしましたー！どうでしたでしょうか？
Thanks for waiting! Sorry to keep you waiting. So, earlier we performed "JANE DOE", "Tsumi to Batsu", and "Asura-chan"! How did you like it?

339
00:46:01,580 --> 00:46:05,580
この後もまだまだライブは続きます！まだ披露していないあんな曲やこんな曲が...
The live continues after this too! There are still songs we haven't shown yet...

340
00:46:06,080 --> 00:46:10,580
あんな曲や！こんな曲や！あるかもねー！
Songs like this! Songs like that! There might be some!

341
00:46:10,580 --> 00:46:17,580
なので、チャンネルはそのままでまだ見ててくれたら嬉しいです！ここでみんなにお知らせをさせてください。こちらです！
So I'd be super happy if you keep watching and leave the channel on! Let me make an announcement to everyone. Here it is!

342
00:46:18,080 --> 00:46:23,580
[Title: 響咲リオナ誕生日記念2026グッズが出ます！やったー！]
[Title: Isaki Riona Birthday Celebration 2026 Goods are out! Yay!]

