午前零時 今 Veil が解け
At midnight, now the veil unravels

363
00:53:45,716 --> 00:53:49,316
I'm breaking into the night まだ夜は覚めやしない
I'm breaking into the night, the night still isn't waking up

364
00:53:49,316 --> 00:53:56,116
さあ 誰も彼も焦がれるままで 私を見て
Come on, while everyone yearns and burns, look at me

365
00:53:57,116 --> 00:53:59,916
Ring my name 響かせ るわ
Ring my name, let it echo

366
00:53:59,916 --> 00:54:04,316
今から watch me like ルミナス 咲き誇れば
From now on, watch me like luminous, if we bloom proudly

367
00:54:04,316 --> 00:54:08,916
きらめく Ray of light 指先まで 艶やかに揺れる
A sparkling ray of light swaying alluringly down to my fingertips

368
00:54:08,916 --> 00:54:13,216
鏡越しのマリオネット 壊れそうに微笑んで
A marionette in the mirror, smiling as if she might break

369
00:54:13,616 --> 00:54:16,616
瞳の奥 Falling in love
Deep in my eyes, falling in love

370
00:54:16,616 --> 00:54:20,216
唇まで Like a ghost I can't stop
Down to my lips, like a ghost I can't stop

371
00:54:20,216 --> 00:54:24,916
巡る走馬灯 さあ 魅せましょう 綺麗な嘘で
Revolving lantern, come on, let's show them with a beautiful lie

372
00:54:24,916 --> 00:54:30,116
飾らないの Masked grace ご期待スキッププロミス それならばいい Shall we dance?
An unadorned masked grace, the skip promise you expected. If so, then fine, shall we dance?

373
00:54:30,116 --> 00:54:35,616
かもされぬれ のれれな 招待 Flavor fly no dancer 今さら Bad マーク 連打 ボットばっか やってられねーな
The invitation... Flavor fly, no dancer. Spamming bad marks now, just bots everywhere, I can't deal with this.

374
00:54:35,616 --> 00:54:43,116
I'm a wonder Can you look away? 魅せつけるの すべてをかけて
I'm a wonder, can you look away? Fascinate them, risking everything

